{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object in sight, approach, grab it, check properties, move to area. Else, scan.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinGrasp    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = MoveObjectToDesignatedArea    />\"",
